# B1.19: src/Diagnostics re-cut by layer (R8, docs/implementation/platform_b1_placements.md; the folders and their
# order ruled by the Solution Architect, 26 Nov 2026, option (B): build/platform/B1/DECISION-R8-files.md). The folders,
# lowest first: model -> content -> derived -> engine; a file includes only its own folder and those before it
# (tools/refactor/dir_order_check.py; ctest diagnostics_dir_order_check). R8's named kinds:
#   model    vocabulary, characteristic, norm, context, pack reading, provider interfaces
#   content  loaders, validators, registries, the packs
#   derived  today's derived facts (B1.6), with series/ (B1.15b): unchanged, not in this map but for the themes pack
#   engine   detect, explain, measure sources, health: on top, it fires findings over everything below it
# Each file is placed by its own header comment, file by file (stems: .h and .cpp together). The ruling's seven
# re-placements against those kinds: the two provider interfaces (norm_provider.h, pack_provider.h) and the condition
# reading (condition_reading.h) to content; the exclusion rule (excludes_rule.h), the measure sample (measure_sample)
# and the delivery-grid numbers (delivery_grid_numbers.h) to model; the themes pack (swing_themes_pack.h) to derived.
# The drill pack moves like any other file; none of its includers change. No ring or context changes (all Rules,
# Diagnostics).

